  "title": "VenoStent Selected as Top 20 MassChallenge Company",
  "summary": "MassChallenge, a global network of zero-equity startup accelerators, announced yesterday the top 20 startups from its 2019 Boston program. These startups, among them, VenoStent, will now advance to the final judging round, where we’ll compete for cash prizes that will be awarded at the MassChallenge Awards on October 24, 2019 in Boston, Massachusetts.",
